In {{g|Battle Revolution}}, Shiny Pokémon have face-sprites which show their Shininess. Random Pokémon in Colosseum can be Shiny, but have the same chance of being Shiny as wild Pokémon. Similarly to Colosseum, the Shiny Pokémon can be drastically different from their core series game counterparts.

The costumes worn by the {{tc|Colosseum Leader}}s also have a 1/8192 chance to appear as Shiny, and if the Leader is encountered and defeated for the first time while wearing the Shiny variant of their outfit, it will grant the player the ability to wear that {{OBP|gear|Battle Revolution}} on their {{OBP|Battle Pass|Battle Revolution}}es.
